"type":"text","value":"tool"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Omit"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"~provider\""},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"~toolKind\""},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tool","text":"tool","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction brandProviderTool<T>(tool): T;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/tools/provider-tool.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/tools/provider-tool.ts#L35)\n\nAttach the `ProviderTool` phantom brand to a plain `Tool`-shaped object.\n\nThe brand fields (`'~provider'`, `'~toolKind'`) exist only in the type\nsystem and are never assigned at runtime, so this is a single audited\ntype-only assertion. Use it inside adapter `xxxTool()` factories instead\nof `as unknown as` — the cast collapses to one named site.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* [`ProviderTool`](../interfaces/ProviderTool.md)\\<`string`, `string`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### tool\n\n`Omit`\\<`T`, `\"~provider\"` \\| `\"~toolKind\"`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`T`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: brandProviderTool\ntitle: brandProviderTool\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction brandProviderTool<T>(tool): T;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/tools/provider-tool.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/tools/provider-tool.ts#L35)\n\nAttach the `ProviderTool` phantom brand to a plain `Tool`-shaped object.\n\nThe brand fields (`'~provider'`, `'~toolKind'`) exist only in the type\nsystem and are never assigned at runtime, so this is a single audited\ntype-only assertion. Use it inside adapter `xxxTool()` factories instead\nof `as unknown as` — the cast collapses to one named site.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* [`ProviderTool`](../interfaces/ProviderTool.md)\\<`string`, `string`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### tool\n\n`Omit`\\<`T`, `\"~provider\"` \\| `\"~toolKind\"`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`T`\n"}
